{"id":3135,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><strong>大数据学院召开2018级毕业生就业推进会</strong></p><p>为贯彻落实毕业生就业相关政策，更好地帮助学生就业，4月26日下午，大数据学院在主楼919会议室召开了毕业生就业工作推进会，院党委副书记杨晓东，就业辅导员和2018级全体返校毕业生参加了会议。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QozUq4UmU8oz6VUp47YLmCPnmVRLRNvaU87DM4LaoRT2oRl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDUSyPLkysMNV7Mm6VnzM7nzLDnmnVUNr2MzUsMzA7LlnFU4NanllPM4TFM4NPMNLJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aMRv0MmGPokbw6268c&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=6018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/26A1076AD67EE3DE36F4EBEF54758D1D/C90EE179/7916C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QozUq4UmU8oz6VUp47YLmCPnmVRLRNvaU87DM4LaoRT2oRl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDUSyPLkysMNV7Mm6VnzM7nzLDnmnVUNr2MzUsMzA7LlnFU4NanllPM4TFM4NPMNLJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aMRv0MmGPokbw6268c&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=6018&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QoR7qsnz9sM4lYMpR9iL4CPMzWRnl7vYozNZUmTVMzARU4-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDMYhRUSybL7V7nNrfLRGDnRfkMNWfoRV7MNM2UzvDLRrFL4UaUlCZo7rFnRT2olUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aMRv0MmGPokbw6268c&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=6018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F67CA90ADFEA006D0B6BA81D6CFA7605/340AF88E/D9F9D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QoR7qsnz9sM4lYMpR9iL4CPMzWRnl7vYozNZUmTVMzARU4-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yDMYhRUSybL7V7nNrfLRGDnRfkMNWfoRV7MNM2UzvDLRrFL4UaUlCZo7rFnRT2olUJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aMRv0MmGPokbw6268c&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=6018&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;会上杨老师主要分析了当前毕业生就业形势和企业岗位需求情况，通过横纵向比较分析了2022届毕业生求职就业中存在的突出问题，对当前就业情况进行了通报。随后了解了每一位毕业生当前的就业状况，摸清了未就业学生具体原因，探讨了促进学生就业的办法，针对毕业生毕业状态为待定的学生，建立了就业帮扶工作台账，摸清就业意向，提供就业指导，为同学们推荐就业信息，关注就业进展，进行持续跟踪服务，同时要求同学们在做好日常疫情防控的前提下，树立正确健康的择业观，增强就业信心，积极就业。<br /></p><p>通过本次会议，进一步明确了就业工作的重点和指导方向。我院将通过分层分类精准指导、充分挖潜就业岗位、开展精准招聘、重点群体帮扶、树立就业典型等措施，主动出击、精准摸排，加强毕业生就业服务和指导，完善毕业生就业促进机制，持续推进2022届毕业生就业工作。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br /></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QozUq4UmU8oz6VUp47YLmCPnmVRLRNvaU87DM4LaoRT2oRl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yDUSyPLkysMNV7Mm6VnzM7nzLDnmnVUNr2MzUsMzA7LlnFU4NanllPM4TFM4NPMNLJv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47aMRv0MmGPokbw6268c&oid=1391370217&tid=1047&nid=6018&e=.png"}